WEBVTT

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:18.260
Nagisa?

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.430
How was the aquarium?

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:22.170
You went with Yukishiro-san, didn't you?

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.470
I guess it was fun.

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:26.940
Now that you mention it...

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:31.420
I heard there was an accident 
at the Water Park that day.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:32.520
An accident?

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:36.820
Something about one of the 
big water tanks breaking.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:39.450
Is that true, Nagisa?

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:44.130
We were all evacuated from the building, so

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:46.590
I'm not sure what happened.

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:49.800
But, if the water tank really did break, 
and all the fish came pouring out

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.750
of the tank, wouldn't it be interesting?

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:53.500
It'd be just like watching a movie in 3D.

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:55.470
I agree... I agree.

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:59.340
I want to go to the Water Park now.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:02.810
Me, too. Come with us, Nagisa.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.040
No way!

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:08.010
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:10.680
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:13.450
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:17.920
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:20.630
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:23.760
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:25.360
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:29.370
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:31.170
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:36.970
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot,</i>

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:38.940
<i>we both</i>

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:40.280
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:42.850
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:46.850
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:49.420
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:52.590
<i>Don't you know that good fortune</i>

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:55.160
<i>comes to the gates of laughter?
Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:55.460 --> 00:02:01.330
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:02.630
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:05.100
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:08.140
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:12.410
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are</i>

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:15.480
<i>Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:19.220
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:27.450
The giant man dropped the 
Prism Stone and disappeared.

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:31.500
I hope this means that 
it's all over now, but...

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:35.000
But there are still three 
Prism Stones left...

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:39.130
Does it mean that someone from Dotsuku 
Zone is always holding on to them?

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:44.190
As long as we have the Prism Stones, 
they'll come after us again.

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:47.230
I don't believe this.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:51.050
It's a new chocolate on the market...

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:53.190
Please try it.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:54.790
Thank you!

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:58.630
What are you doing here?

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:01.560
I'm giving out samples... 
Would you like to try one?

00:03:03.170 --> 00:03:05.760
Chocolate! Can I have one?

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.970
Of course!

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:11.020
All right! Thank you.

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:12.240
You love chocolate don't you?

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:15.180
I love it so much that 
I hope when I'm reborn,

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:17.210
I'll come back as chocolate.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.940
Then please take as much as you want.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:23.050
Are you sure?

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:26.080
It's like "silver from Heaven," isn't it?

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:29.890
Don't you mean "pennies from 
Heaven" (stroke of good luck)?

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:31.950
Was that it?

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:34.190
In any case, I'm super lucky!

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.060
This looks delicious...

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:41.880
So does this... And this... And this...

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:43.970
I really don't know which one to choose.

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:46.500
Which one should I take?

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:49.910
Za... kenna!

00:03:52.110 --> 00:03:53.880
Thank you!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:56.970
Not at all... Please enjoy the samples!

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:06.990
Nagisa Misumi... Member of Verone 
Academy's lacrosse team...

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:09.830
Very athletic, and popular in school.

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:11.880
Her favorite food... Chocolate.

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:14.300
Her shortcoming is that she's a scatterbrain.

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:17.810
See how easily I was able to fool her?

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:22.870
Next!

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:30.880
"THE EVIL FLOWER! POISONNY APPEARS"

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:29.880
"THE EVIL FLOWER! POISONNY APPEARS"

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:37.990
The presence of the Prism 
Stones has disappeared again.

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:42.160
First, it was Pisard's, 
and now it's Gekidrago's.

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.940
I'm sorry.

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:46.810
The only thing that can 
release me from my pain

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:49.810
and suffering is the power 
of the Prism Stones.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:54.160
The only way is to get all 
seven stones in my hands.

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:58.380
Destroy them all and get the stones!

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:03.110
Then, with the power of darkness, 
we will annihilate everything.

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:10.450
Where's the Prism Stone?

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.060
Where's the stone?

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:22.870
I'll take my time, and cook you later.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.340
Which one should I eat first?

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:28.850
If he sees me eating, Mepple will complain.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:30.410
So I'll feed Mepple first.

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:36.110
Zakenna!

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:37.650
What is this?

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:41.500
Zakenna!

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:45.270
Zakenna...!

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:48.770
Get away!

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:52.430
Zakenna!

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:55.260
FOOL!

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:55.270
Zakenna!

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:57.730
Go away!

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:58.760
Zakenna!

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:02.620
What am I going to do?

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:05.510
The chocolate girl took Mepple.

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:10.450
Honoka's in danger!

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:17.080
Honoka Yukishiro... Member of 
Verone Academy's science club.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:21.390
Clear-headed and a student 
with top grades in school.

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:23.110
The person she admires most is Dr. Breckston,

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:26.400
the top physicist of the century.

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:29.520
Since she was little, her parents have 
been prone to being away from home.

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:32.200
Presently, she is living 
with her grandmother.

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:36.540
Yukishiro

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:36.540
Where did Honoka go?

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:41.140
She said she was going to stop at 
the library on her way home today.

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:42.210
The library?

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:44.750
What did you want with Honoka?

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:46.660
It's nothing, really...

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:49.750
When Honoka comes home, please 
give her a message from me...

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:51.790
Tell her the choco girl is 
"majiyaba" (really dangerous).

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:53.660
The chooco is maji...?

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:03.000
This must be something serious!

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:14.150
Hello...

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:16.040
Hello.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:18.440
Are you in middle school?

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:20.590
Yes... I am.

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:23.600
You're the same age as my granddaughter.

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:29.530
I'm sorry... It's just that you 
look so much like my granddaughter.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:30.830
Do I?

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:35.070
If I don't hurry, the chocolate 
girl will get Mipple, too.

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:39.080
Is that right?

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:42.500
You have a grandmother about 
the same age as me...

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:45.160
I'm living with her now.

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:46.580
Is that right?

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:51.000
Why isn't she here?

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.520
Where are you, Honoka?

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:58.050
Is something wrong?

00:07:58.050 --> 00:07:59.920
No... It's nothing.

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.890
Come out... Please!

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:05.920
What if Mipple's taken, too?

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:07.870
What am I going to do?

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.510
Excuse me for a minute.

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:14.870
I sense Mepple's presence mipo.

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:18.910
Don't tell me it's too late?

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:21.880
Don't do it, Honoka... Chocolate's no good!

00:08:23.510 --> 00:08:25.650
Mepple is close by mipo.

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:28.450
Don't tell me Nagisa is around here?

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:31.920
I can feel him really close by mipo.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:35.060
I'm sorry... I'm talking 
to someone right now,

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:37.030
so can you be quiet for a little while?

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.730
Is something wrong?

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:41.530
No... It's nothing.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:45.220
What kind of flower do you like?

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:50.280
I like any kind of flower, 
but cosmos are nice...

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:53.340
That's a very refreshing flower, isn't it?

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:01.160
It's beautiful!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.620
What just happened?

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:07.690
I wonder how far the field of flowers goes...

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:14.970
This can't be...! Am I dreaming?

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:17.120
Why is this happening?

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:22.540
That's...!

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:27.710
Dr. Breckston!

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:29.180
That's right.

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:32.070
It's like a dream!

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:34.150
But what are you doing here?

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:37.450
I was waiting for you, Honoka Yukishiro.

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:40.660
How did you know my name?

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:45.380
I know everything.

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:48.630
Because I'm a man who can get 
closest to various truths.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:50.560
That's awesome!

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:54.770
But I thought you passed 
away several decades ago...

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.210
That's just it...

00:09:57.210 --> 00:10:00.410
There was just one thing that 
I regret leaving behind...

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:01.800
What do you mean?

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:04.080
It's that thing you have.

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:08.180
Will you let me borrow that?

00:10:08.180 --> 00:10:11.750
With that, I can complete my research.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.690
I will know the truth about various worlds.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:19.050
Dr. Breckston is asking you, young lady...

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:19.930
Give it to him.

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:23.000
But...

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:25.060
This is...

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:28.270
Please give that to me, Honoka.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:31.480
We can see the truth of 
the universe together.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:52.560
Please give that to me, Honoka.

00:10:58.660 --> 00:10:59.800
Come on...

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:05.810
Honoka?

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:08.850
Grandmother?

00:11:10.470 --> 00:11:13.160
I was just talking to the professor...

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:16.480
Who is this, Honoka?

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:20.860
I made friends with her just now.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.640
Is that right?

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.190
Pleased to meet you.

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:25.670
My pleasure.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.140
Who are you?

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:39.400
What are you talking about?

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:44.150
A real grandmother can tell if you're a real

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:47.120
grandmother or a fake grandmother.

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:50.430
What were you trying to 
do to Honoka just now?

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:56.200
All you have to do is hand that over to me.

00:11:57.290 --> 00:11:59.560
Don't tell me, you're...?

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:13.210
What is this?

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:14.680
What in the world is happening?

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:20.790
Show them how frightening the 
power of darkness can be.

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:28.090
Wake up, everyone!

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:34.470
Stop it!

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:37.100
Honoka! Honoka!

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:39.400
Grandmother!

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:42.380
Honoka!

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:45.150
Honoka...!

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:57.750
Honoka!

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:00.130
Honoka!

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:00.990
Mipple!

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:02.660
Mipple...!

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:05.460
Nagisa!

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:11.500
What's this...?

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.340
This feeling...

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:25.060
It feels so nostalgic.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:31.880
Stop it!

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:49.140
Grandmother! Are you okay?

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.480
I'm okay.

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:55.220
She shared some of her strength with me.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.990
Who are you anyway?

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:07.820
You really are a troublesome 
bunch, aren't you?

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:10.460
Just hand over what you have in your hands.

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:12.630
I can't give it to you.

00:14:12.630 --> 00:14:13.500
This is...

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:16.900
This is something that Honoka treasures.

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:18.470
I absolutely refuse to give it to you.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:19.770
Grandmother!

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:22.970
Letting your stubborn pride get in 
the way isn't good for your health.

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:25.180
Grandma!

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:32.060
Honoka!

00:14:32.060 --> 00:14:33.520
Give it to me!

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:48.350
Grandmother...?

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:49.000
Watch out, Grandma!

00:14:55.050 --> 00:14:56.980
Grandmother!

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:07.450
Are you okay, Grandmother?

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:10.370
I'm okay.

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:13.850
She must have saved me again...

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:14.930
Grandmother.

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:17.800
I guess it's not good to be too stubborn.

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:19.460
I'm a little tired.

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:24.900
Grandmother...? Grandmother!

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.840
What have you done?

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:31.080
Her grandmother has nothing 
to do with this, does she?

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:32.260
I won't forgive you.

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:34.880
I won't forgive you!

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:36.970
Who do you think you are?

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:39.680
You know you can't transform without this.

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:40.950
Mepple!

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.930
Nagisa! Good morning mepo!

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:54.190
How can you be so carefree?

00:15:54.190 --> 00:15:55.230
Behind you! Look behind you!

00:15:58.550 --> 00:16:00.500
What is going on mepo?

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:02.540
Hurry, and save me mepo!

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:05.210
I can't breathe...

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:09.210
If you don't want him destroyed, 
then hand over the other one.

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:12.000
Stop it! Give Mepple back!

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.620
Mepple!

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:16.490
I could always just destroy 
him first, and then

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:19.560
take the other one. It's all the same to me.

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:23.360
I'll just take my time later and ask that one

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:24.910
where the Prism Stones are.

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:27.500
If you want to save him, 
just hand that one over!

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:30.850
Nagisa!

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:33.640
Stop it! Let Mepple go!

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:38.590
Believe! Just believe...

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:41.620
Believe in yourself.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:46.920
Believe in your friends... 
Believe in those around you.

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:48.800
Grandmother...?

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:50.760
Mepple!

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:53.390
Mepo!

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:58.600
Mepo! Mepo! Mepo! Mepo! Mepo! Mepo! Mepo!

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:03.100
Mepo...

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:04.600
Let's transform.

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:12.310
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:45.040
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:47.910
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.780
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:55.190
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:58.620
Go back to where you came from!

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:04.590
She's gone.

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:06.720
Did she go back to where she came from?

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:07.900
Looks like it.

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:18.660
I don't suppose we could leave 
them like that, could we?

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.610
Let's restore them to the way they were.

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:23.000
Black Pulsar!

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:25.020
White Pulsar!

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:34.360
You, who have been taken prisoner 
by the spell of darkness...

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:37.330
Sever that chain now!

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:42.050
Pretty Cure Rainbow Therapy!

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:25.630
I'd better hurry home, and prepare dinner.

00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:27.570
Thank you.

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:29.250
Will you be okay by yourself?

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:34.240
I'm fine. After that sound 
sleep, I feel much better.

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:37.660
Don't come home too late, Honoka.

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:45.220
Didn't your grandma see us, Honoka?

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:48.630
I wonder... She was asleep.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:51.940
But she must have sensed 
something, seeing all

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:55.080
those zombie-like people 
right in front of her.

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:57.870
But she said she was dreaming.

00:19:57.870 --> 00:20:01.680
That's a lie... Aren't you the one 
who's most concerned about all this?

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:07.860
If people around us found out what happened

00:20:07.860 --> 00:20:09.780
to us, do you think things would change?

00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:12.370
I want things to stay the way they are now...

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:16.090
...with everyone, and the same as 
always with my grandmother, too.

00:20:16.090 --> 00:20:17.030
Honoka?

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:21.430
It's all your fault to begin with, Nagisa...
For being lured by all that chocolate mepo!

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:24.110
You should talk!

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:27.410
Who was fast asleep through 
all that utter confusion?

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:31.710
But everyone was saved because 
I got away from her mepo.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:35.270
You really are unadorable.

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:39.040
If you were going to do that, 
you should have escaped sooner.

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:41.020
Making me worry like that.

00:20:41.020 --> 00:20:44.870
Who asked you to worry about me mepo!

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:47.060
I can manage just fine on my own mepo!

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.350
How dare you!

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.930
Who do you think is taking 
care of you anyway?

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.500
Calm down, Nagisa...

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:54.620
Keep out of this, Honoka!

00:20:55.240 --> 00:20:56.870
I've had just about enough!

00:20:56.870 --> 00:21:00.360
Besides, Nagisa... you lack 
a feeling of trust mepo.

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:03.650
You could trust me a little more mepo.

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:06.520
Who would trust you!

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:12.100
I believe in you mepo.

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:16.690
I believed in you, Nagisa.

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:19.240
That's why I ran like that mepo.

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:22.100
I wasn't thinking about 
anything at the time mepo.

00:21:22.100 --> 00:21:24.600
I believe in you, Nagisa mepo!

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:27.570
Mepple...

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:33.160
Believe in yourself...

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:38.320
Believe in your friends. 
Believe in those around you.

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:43.580
I'm sorry, Mepple.

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:56.450
We'll all continue the 
same as always, won't we?

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:05.340
Okay... Chutaro... I'll fix your dinner, too.

00:22:07.520 --> 00:22:09.920
Go back to where you came from!

00:22:12.520 --> 00:22:13.890
That's what she said.

00:22:17.810 --> 00:22:19.130
I'm home!

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:25.460
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.290 --> 00:22:26.990
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:26.990 --> 00:22:29.690
<i>L-O-V-E Love Love, get you!</i>

00:22:29.790 --> 00:22:32.430
<i>I can't do this!</i>

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:35.700
<i>I'd rather be a young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:38.140
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:42.270
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.810 --> 00:22:47.980
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:51.720
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.380 --> 00:22:55.450
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.590 --> 00:22:59.820
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.960 --> 00:23:06.460
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.570 --> 00:23:10.840
<i>I'm a teenager with a</i>

00:23:10.840 --> 00:23:14.070
<i>heart throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:14.070 --> 00:23:16.810
<i>I don't want to lose that</i>

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:20.580
<i>normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:23.080
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:23.310 --> 00:23:26.550
<i>It's romance rather than stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.550 --> 00:23:28.720
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:32.020
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.320 --> 00:23:35.060
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:38.330
<i>I'd rather cuddle than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.330 --> 00:23:40.570
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.570 --> 00:23:43.100
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:44.500
<i>So why am I</i>

00:23:44.640 --> 00:23:46.100
<i>stuffing my face</i>

00:23:46.170 --> 00:23:49.810
<i>with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.680 --> 00:23:55.930
Honoka... Did you know that 
the transfer student in

00:23:55.930 --> 00:23:58.280
the Boys Division is very 
athletic and good-looking?

00:23:58.280 --> 00:24:01.520
We're going to have a science 
research project program.

00:24:01.520 --> 00:24:03.410
You should come too, Nagisa. 
Fujimura-kun will be there.

00:24:03.410 --> 00:24:05.210
My heart's pounding.

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:06.790
Isn't there something strange 
in the science project room?

00:24:06.790 --> 00:24:09.160
Oh, no! Zakenna has possessed 
Honoka's experiment.

00:24:09.160 --> 00:24:10.720
It's unforgivable to use Zakenna to take over

00:24:10.720 --> 00:24:12.410
what everyone made for the program.

00:24:12.410 --> 00:24:15.800
"BEWARE! THE YOUNG TRANSFER STUDENT"

00:24:15.800 --> 00:24:17.970
I prefer older men over younger men.

00:24:17.970 --> 00:24:20.000
Oh, no! What have I done!
